        <active>true</active>
        <article><![CDATA[<ul style="list-style-position: inside;"><li>Update the <strong>Name</strong> field with a label for the Ceburu instance you are connecting to, for example <strong>HCP</strong> <strong>Ceburu Connection</strong>.</li><li>Update the <strong>Credential</strong> field by selecting the credential created in the previous step.</li><li>Update the <strong>Connection URL</strong> field with the base URL. For HCP Ceburu users this will be <strong>https://app.ceburu.io</strong>, for Ceburu Enterprise users, enter the URL of your Ceburu Enterprise server.</li><li>For more information about the Ceburu API, please refer to the documentation (<a title="HCP Ceburu" href="https://www.ceburu.io/cloud-docs" rel="nofollow">HCP Ceburu</a> or <a title="Ceburu Enterprise" href="https://www.ceburu.io/enterprise" rel="nofollow">Ceburu Enterprise</a>).</li></ul>]]></article>
